<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's fuel oil prices mainly unchanged in July.</title>
<headline>Morocco's fuel oil prices mainly unchanged in July.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's monthly fuel oil price has been set at 1,662.9 dirhams ($175) per tonne in July, unchanged from the previous month, the energy ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Gas oil fell 15 cents to 4.71 dirhams a litre while kerosene was unchanged at 3.24 dirhams a litre.</p>
<p>Pump prices for ordinary and super petrol remained unchanged at 7.42 and 7.65 dirhams.</p>
<p>&quot;These prices have been calculated on the basis of average quotations on the Rotterdam market between May 28 and June 27,&quot; the ministry said.</p>
<p>($1 = 9.5 dirhams)</p>
</text>
